{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-15","kind":"proposition","title":"对顶角相等","englishTitle":"If two straight lines cut one another, they make the vertical angles equal to one another.","book":1,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","contentId":"euclid-1-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"044ec52758c1102d463dc45c5617a674be7712b5bc5366f7597dde528cd1d598","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-15.statement","euclid-1-15.construction.1","euclid-1-15.proof.1","euclid-1-15.proof.2","euclid-1-15.proof.3","euclid-1-15.proof.4","euclid-1-15.proof.5","euclid-1-15.proof.6","euclid-1-15.proof.7","euclid-1-15.historical.1","euclid-1-15.historical.2","euclid-1-15.historical.3","euclid-1-15.historical.4","euclid-1-15.historical.5","euclid-1-15.historical.6","euclid-1-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d43e5290a9123325c0f84cf91d65d2caaed7c7f114e4404c4a6e6d5d4c7dec4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines cut one another, they make the vertical angles equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线互相切开,对顶角线就等于彼此。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡两直线相交作四角每两交角必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条直线相交所形成的四个角中，每一对对顶角都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58438385bf0c1e499467ec3dabdb8023b43763e15d1e92b51496eb01ca7456e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight lines AB, CD cut one another at the point E;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD直线在E点相互切开;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8505a204301dc767f492903dcf4c5e7dab8ebbc868078fdf2f358c4b1de778a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle AEC is equal to the angle DEB, and the angle CEB to the angle AED."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AEC角等于DEB角,CEB角等于AED角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98b0ad1d09b050707e45b7487ec7d18d7ae98765efb3c94c4019819b3989b94f","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the straight line AE stands on the straight line CD, making the angles CEA, AED, the angles CEA, AED are equal to two right angles [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AE线是直线CD线, 角度是CEA, AED, 角度是CEA, AED等于2,直角 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9df97aa11e213df976b582b48f377d148fcd5fbc7d12b679f7c8853251c2745c","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the straight line DE stands on the straight line AB, making the angles AED, DEB, the angles AED, DEB are equal to two right angles. [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DE线直线位于AB线上,角度为AED、DEB,角度为AED、DEB等于2 直角。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5cc882e132ae0116cd77869a80d5b082add1cc26f0f68b07b20af084a47ee23","citations":["euclid-1-post-4","euclid-1-cn-1","euclid-1-cn-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles CEA, AED were also proved equal to two right angles; therefore the angles CEA, AED are equal to the angles AED DEB. [[Post. 4](/principles/euclid-1-post-4) and [C. N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] Let the angle AED be subtracted from each; therefore the remaining angle CEA is equal to the remaining angle BED. [[C. N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CEA,AED的角度也证明等于2,直角;因此CEA,AED的角度等于AED,DEB的角度（相关点与线段：BED） [ [Post. 4](/principles/euclid-1-post-4) [C. N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1) [[C. N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"021fb52ae6d1d59e9fbb555553dddffbece475f07599b44ebced5e27e9311e55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that the angles CEB, DEA are also equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明,CEB、DEA的角度也是一样的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffd236a86f3e1a07afe81811e8d696698aa4eb6029987ccd6b083ccb69b5d50f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Porism. From this it is manifest that, if two straight lines cut one another, they will make the angles at the point of section equal to four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[波兰。从这一点来看,很明显,如果两条直线相互切开,它们将使点角等于4 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcc623fe9ce150f9f1629fcbd22065f6c6f3507a4bcdbb3aebb6c769fc8ce213","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡两直线相交作四角每两交角必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条直线相交所形成的四个角中，每一对对顶角都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"646176af5d05d2f9b5c9f28f1deb14f40b72f80efff38535a7b7fbd1c53053d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙与丙丁两线相交于戊题言甲戊丙与丁戊乙两角甲戊丁与丙戊乙两角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙与丙丁两线相交于戊命题说明甲戊丙与丁戊乙两角甲戊丁与丙戊乙两角各等"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8797f8d563d842cc1f31f47521829e35a4b734572221d01caf2a96fcb4ea4ddb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丁戊线至甲乙线上则甲戊丁丁戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉甲戊线至丙丁线上则甲戊丙甲戊丁两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即丁戊乙甲戊丁两角亦与甲戊丁甲戊内两角等〈公论十〉试减同用之甲戊丁角其所存丁戊乙甲戊丙两角必等〈公论〉〈三〉又丁戊线至甲乙线上则甲戊丁丁戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉乙戊线至丙丁线上则丁戊乙丙戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲戊丁丁戊乙两角亦与丁戊乙丙戊乙两角〈公论十〉试减同用之丁戊乙角其所存甲戊丁丙戊乙必等一系推显两直线相交于中点上作四角与四直角等二系一点之上两直线相交不论几许线几许角定与四直角等〈公论十八〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丁戊线至甲乙线上则甲戊丁丁戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉甲戊线至丙丁线上则甲戊丙甲戊丁两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即丁戊乙甲戊丁两角亦与甲戊丁甲戊内两角等〈公论十〉试减同用之甲戊丁角其所存丁戊乙甲戊丙两角必等〈公论〉〈三〉又丁戊线至甲乙线上则甲戊丁丁戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉乙戊线至丙丁线上则丁戊乙丙戊乙两角与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲戊丁丁戊乙两角亦与丁戊乙丙戊乙两角〈公论十〉试减同用之丁戊乙角其所存甲戊丁丙戊乙必等一系推显两直线相交于中点上作四角与四直角等二系一点之上两直线相交不论几许线几许角定与四直角等〈公论十八〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb8fca1b5c1aa358fa0614aac911e451429fb4e0408314a5c630352790b4277a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"===増题一直线内出不同方两直线而所作两交角===等即后出两线为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"补充命题：从同一条直线上的一点向两侧引出两条直线；如果它们与原直线所成的一对对顶角相等，那么这两条新引出的线合成一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f96907f72d5e067d99fe4e04f770f63d73006f3c591ae0528a9379bbbfee1509","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙线内取丙点出丙丁丙戊两线而所作甲丙戊丁丙乙两交角等或甲丙丁戊丙乙两交角等题言戊丙丙丁即一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙线内取丙点出丙丁丙戊两线而所作甲丙戊丁丙乙两交角等或甲丙丁戊丙乙两交角等命题说明戊丙丙丁即一直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-15.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-1-15","revisionId":"euclid-1-15@raw-044ec52758c1102d","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"129b8ac9150aad0c51fb0b06c50bec607ace198244faa826b8421a33e6cab457","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙戊角既与丁丙乙角等每加一戊丙乙角即甲丙戊戊丙乙两角必与丁丙乙戊丙乙两角等〈公论二〉而甲丙戊戊丙乙与两直角等〈本篇十三〉则丁丙乙戊丙乙亦与两直角等是戊丙丙丁为一直线〈本篇十四〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲丙戊角既与丁丙乙角等每加一戊丙乙角即甲丙戊戊丙乙两角必与丁丙乙戊丙乙两角等〈公论二〉而甲丙戊戊丙